        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml seq_booking\ntitle Tuần Tự (Sequence Diagram) - Đặt Lịch Hẹn\n\nactor \&quot;Bệnh nhân\&quot; as BN\nparticipant \&quot;:DatLichUI\&quot; as UI\nparticipant \&quot;:AppointmentService\&quot; as AptSvc\nparticipant \&quot;:DentistService\&quot; as DentSvc\ndatabase \&quot;:CSDL\&quot; as DB\n\nBN -&gt; UI: 1. Chọn Nha sĩ, Ngày hẹn, Khung giờ\nactivate UI\n\nUI -&gt; AptSvc: 2. validateAndBook(dentistId, date, slot)\nactivate AptSvc\n\nAptSvc -&gt; DentSvc: 3. isSlotAvailable(dentistId, date, slot)\nactivate DentSvc\n\nDentSvc -&gt; DB: 4. SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Appointment\\nWHERE dentistId=? AND date=? AND slot=? AND status=&#39;DaXacNhan&#39;\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; DentSvc: 5. Tra ve so luong (count)\ndeactivate DB\n\nDentSvc --&gt; AptSvc: 6. Tra ve trang thai slot (true/false)\ndeactivate DentSvc\n\nalt Con slot trong (count == 0)\n  AptSvc -&gt; DB: 7. INSERT INTO Appointment (status=&#39;DaXacNhan&#39;)\n  activate DB\n  DB --&gt; AptSvc: 8. Tra ve appointmentId\n  deactivate DB\n  AptSvc --&gt; UI: 9. Tra ve ket qua Dat lich thanh cong\n  UI --&gt; BN: 10. Hien thi thong bao &amp; Ma lich hen\nelse Khong con slot trong (count &gt; 0)\n  AptSvc --&gt; UI: 11. Bao loi: Khung gio da co nguoi dat\n  UI --&gt; BN: 12. De xuat cac khung gio con trong khac\nend\n\ndeactivate AptSvc\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="I12sn7LnhGPiePR9djo5-304">
